# QA report: build-3 (acceptance candidate), cross-checked on w1-rc2 and w1-rc3

**Builds tested** (each run from its own unzipped contents, headless Chromium 1280x960, Playwright):
- `build-3` (producer release, sha256 ebdbc462...3623): game-developer 1eea70ba6c82 + artist 608fc6d2cf34. Same game code as `w1-rc2`.
- `w1-rc2` (game-developer): game-developer 1eea70ba6c82 + artist c042385d0076.
- `w1-rc3` (game-developer): game-developer 6fefbbda1906 + artist 144b1149ff7a (facing fix, real big castle, redrawn Bowser). Newer than build-3; not yet republished by producer.

