## Previously reported, now verified fixed
- game-developer#7 (4-high pipes blocked 1-1): fixed, the 1-1 bot passes every pipe, stairs and the flag.
- game-developer#8 (sub-frame key press dropped): fixed, check G4 passes.
- 1-3 big castle placeholder (artist#5): fixed in build-3 and rc3 (real brick castle drawn, screenshot checked).

## New defect
- game-developer#11 (minor): 1-2, jumping off the right end of the ceiling route leaves Mario running forever offscreen at y=-14. Reproduced on build-3, w1-rc2, w1-rc3.

## What was checked in P2 (all pass unless listed)
- Lifts: every lift of 1-2 (2 down, 2 up), 1-3 (1 vertical, 3 horizontal), 1-4 (1 horizontal): Mario lands on it from above, rides with a gap under 2 px, and it moves; fall-lifts fall. (An earlier "up lift fails" result from my placing Mario 1 px above a lift already moving up was a test artifact; landing on it from above works.)
- 1-2: auto-walk intro, timer starts at 400, coin room, exit pipe, Piranha Plants, warp zone (three pipes leading to the end screen since worlds 2-8 do not exist), flag, on to 1-3.
- 1-3: Koopa and red Paratroopa, checkpoint, flag, castle walk-in, time tally, fireworks, on to 1-4.
- 1-4: rotating firebars hurt Mario, lava kills, Bowser (fireball kill, flame), axe, bridge collapse, Toad message, end screen.
- Flow: lives, score, power carry between levels; game over returns to the title.
- Traversability (`search_bot.py`, macro search in god mode, enemies ignored): 1-3 reaches the flag and 1-4 reaches the axe using run-jumps and lifts, so neither has a gap that cannot be crossed.

## Observations (not claimed as defects)
- 1-4 has no Podoboo in the level data (the class exists); the level looks simpler and more linear than the original.
- The axe sits on a pillar, so small Mario has to jump to reach it.
- build-3 shows Koopas, Paratroopas and Bowser walking backwards (artist's finding, game-developer#10); `w1-rc3` fixes it, so the acceptance candidate should be rc3 or later.
- 1-1 staircase at cols 138-139 has a 2-tile gap (from build-1; not re-checked against the original).

## Not checked
Audio fidelity and music loop feel by ear; real-keyboard feel (inputs are scripted); a fair full play-through of 1-2..1-4 with all enemies (playtester's job); firebar timing against the original; pixel-accuracy against the original game.

